The transcript shows the main planning tradeoff: low grasps limited finger clearance, while higher grasps ran into reach limits. Remeasuring the bore preceded successful passage. But releasing for the first head regrasp also coincided with a measured 25 mm drop just before engagement, so I’ll preserve support-before-release guidance rather than treat that transition as a reliable procedure.
